    <div>
      <h2>Something to try before we ever meet</h2>
      {#- Paced breathing is not settling for everyone with trauma or panic, and
          "tells a nervous system it is allowed to stand down" stated a
          simplification as physiology. The opt-out has to be readable before
          the Start button, not after. -#}
      <p>For many people a longer out-breath than in-breath is settling, and one minute is
      enough to find out whether it is for you. If attending to your breath feels uncomfortable,
      skip the circle: notice your feet on the floor, or look around the room and name three
      things you can see. Stop whenever you like.</p>
      <p>If the circle distracts you, ignore it and count: in for four, hold for two, out for
      six.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="settle" data-running="false">
      <div class="settle__ring"><span>one minute</span></div>
      <button type="button">Start</button>
      <p>In for four, hold for two, out for six.</p>
    </div>
    </div>

